      "raw": "[quote=\"Yoshi348\"]\n\nI actually had trouble connecting on another computer, but changing the https to http fixed it, even though it eventually went back to https.\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nI updated Firefox, then tried to go onto the site, and couldn&#39;t connect. &nbsp;Firefox, however, opined on its own that it might not be able to load the site because of my security settings, and offered to reset them to defaults. &nbsp;Once I did that, it loaded fine. &nbsp; Might be related to the Http:-Https: thing.\n",
